# Build context of the images in docker/ (context = repository root).
# Keep it small and keep secrets out: nothing here may reach a layer.

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/coverage
out

# Generated code: rebuilt inside the image (`prisma generate`)
**/src/modules/prisma/generated

# Secrets and local configuration (the example file stays)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
_avast_

# Not needed to build or run (`.gitignore` stays: `turbo prune` filters by it)
**/test
**/*.md
.git
.husky
.claude
.vscode
.fallow
graphify-out
